sequenceDiagram
  %% command: instance:rollback
  %% kind: instance.rollback
  %% status: migrated
  autonumber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant SW as Swamp
  participant N as AppProd Node<br/>Instance owner
  CLI->>GW: instance:rollback<br/>previous release
  GW->>GW: Hold the Instance<br/>confirm its rollback commit
  GW->>SW: Start production-release<br/>private Operation input
  SW->>N: Confirm current live<br/>check retained commit
  SW->>N: Start the stopped old<br/>apply current environment
  SW->>N: Check candidate readiness
  SW->>N: Switch Instance Routes<br/>hand over Processes and Schedules
  SW->>N: Drain and stop old live<br/>retain it stopped for rollback
  SW->>N: Read live and old commits
  SW-->>GW: Verified release receipt<br/>Node, Instance, commit and digest
  GW-->>CLI: Record the result<br/>verified live and rollback commits
